## Path-dependent rules

If your project has commands, data formats, or domain background that only matters when a
session actually touches specific paths, don't put them in this always-loaded file. Most agent
tools support some form of path-scoped rule file; the mechanism and its exact glob syntax are
tool-specific, so they are documented in the tool's own instruction file rather than here.
